# Validation — Advanced

Enable when rule level includes `advanced`.

- Single schema/source for rules shared by client + server when the stack allows
- Cross-field rules (e.g. end ≥ start, password confirm match)
- Uniqueness / existence checks via API with debounced client feedback
- Localized validation messages when i18n is in Profile
- Normalize before validate (trim, phone digits) consistently FE + BE
- Document validation constants next to domain rules when limits are business-critical
